<title>JAPAN: Tsuchiya Home -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tsuchiya Home -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to April 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 19.46		vs	   15.99</p>
<p> Operating	  798    million	  vs	  977    million</p>
<p> Current	    688    million	  vs	    1.05</p>
<p> Net		  302    million	  vs	  560    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.40 yen	  vs	   27.88 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     25 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tsuchiya Home Co Ltd is a builder of order-made homes.</p>
